    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wholesaler Simulator</strong> offers a detailed and realistic simulation experience where you can master the art of trading. Players start by purchasing products from producers. They can negotiate for better deals and store their goods in rented warehouses. By selling these products, players earn money, which they can use to expand their business and build a larger trading network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/9f41352ebe999c35ec97c1fc296e34ce.webp?t=1753912942\" width=363 height=26 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your bargaining skills to buy products at the best possible prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/57533900a085421f870a7ba10c5b70f0.poster.avif?t=1753912942\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/57533900a085421f870a7ba10c5b70f0.webm?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/57533900a085421f870a7ba10c5b70f0.mp4?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/15f6472b65b9beb705aa7653068a1377.webp?t=1753912942\" width=245 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent warehouses to store and organize your inventory efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/998080bbaa2885f68a616445f5441d1f.poster.avif?t=1753912942\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/998080bbaa2885f68a616445f5441d1f.webm?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/998080bbaa2885f68a616445f5441d1f.mp4?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/117da1b26ea21fc8ff8b9bed6244696b.webp?t=1753912942\" width=315 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver orders to customers and earn more profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/3d9e10e86dcabda70573ddd55e7c7c43.poster.avif?t=1753912942\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/3d9e10e86dcabda70573ddd55e7c7c43.webm?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/3d9e10e86dcabda70573ddd55e7c7c43.mp4?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/8e0505f317dd3bb9cf1288c80784035e.webp?t=1753912942\" width=304 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your warehouse capacity, purchase new vehicles, and expand your workforce to scale your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/eef910480048dcd51d361fc5d3e11a29.poster.avif?t=1753912942\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/eef910480048dcd51d361fc5d3e11a29.webm?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/eef910480048dcd51d361fc5d3e11a29.mp4?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/66f894c840275a59967dc282db56dac4.webp?t=1753912942\" width=164 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage every stage of your supply chain. Purchase goods from producers at the right time, optimize storage costs, and deliver products to customers quickly and efficiently to grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/cfbfcd01c070a4ab6b3238b618941887.poster.avif?t=1753912942\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/cfbfcd01c070a4ab6b3238b618941887.webm?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/cfbfcd01c070a4ab6b3238b618941887.mp4?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/29e97b94a802d67b91f4dffb67362b1a.webp?t=1753912942\" width=201 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and fulfill customer orders using the in-game sales application on your PC.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wholesaler Simulator</strong> offers a detailed and realistic simulation experience where you can master the art of trading. Players start by purchasing products from producers. They can negotiate for better deals and store their goods in rented warehouses. By selling these products, players earn money, which they can use to expand their business and build a larger trading network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/9f41352ebe999c35ec97c1fc296e34ce.webp?t=1753912942\" width=363 height=26 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your bargaining skills to buy products at the best possible prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/57533900a085421f870a7ba10c5b70f0.poster.avif?t=1753912942\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/57533900a085421f870a7ba10c5b70f0.webm?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/57533900a085421f870a7ba10c5b70f0.mp4?t=1753912942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390420/extras/15f6472b65b9beb705aa7653068a1377.webp?t=1753912942\" width=245 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent warehouses to store and organize your inventory efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph